      "body": "The diff explosion comes from `.agent/dist/` — **456 of the 457 changed files** are compiled agent infrastructure artifacts (JS bundles, `.d.ts` type declarations, `.js.map` source maps). The only substantive change is [`quartz.layout.ts`](https://github.com/augmented-mind/augmented-mind.github.io/blob/main/quartz.layout.ts), which swaps in the live giscus `repoId` and `categoryId`.\n\nThe root cause: `.agent/dist/` is not in `.gitignore`, so the compiled TypeScript output got committed alongside the real change.\n\n**Fix**: add `.agent/dist/` to `.gitignore`. Since `main` already shows `?? .agent/dist/` as untracked, this should be straightforward — either:\n\n1. Add `.agent/dist/` to `.gitignore` and re-open this PR with only `quartz.layout.ts` changed, or\n2. Squash/rebase this PR to strip the dist files before merge.",
